  "updated_at": "2026-04-17",
  "bio": "Pascale Davies is a self-taught tattoo artist hailing from Badung, Indonesia, renowned for their distinctive minimalist and vegan tattoo designs. They combine a passion for menswear print and graphic design into their tattoo work, crafting pieces that are truly unique and made with love. Pascale maintains a high level of professionalism in their practice, ensuring clients are treated with respect and given top-notch service from design consultation all the way through to the final ink.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Badung, Indonesia"
